Fadouse
=======

Source of https://fadouse.github.io, my personal site and blog.

The site is static.  A Rust builder turns Markdown into complete HTML
pages, with code highlighting and math rendered at build time.  A no_std
WebAssembly module, kept below 15 kB, then adds page transitions, search
and reading aids on top of pages that are already complete.

    content/    posts and media
    app/        WebAssembly module and stylesheet
    shared/     types shared by the module and the builder
    xtask/      builder and local server

Building needs rustup and Trunk 0.21.14; shell.nix provides both.

    cargo xtask build --site-url http://127.0.0.1:8187 --preview
    cargo xtask serve

